WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:01.970
Well, our trip was over.

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:03.580
And I'm happy the say that not even

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.030
Jordan could ruin Italy for me.

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.820
We had an unforgettable time.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.596
And our journey's already being lauded

00:00:09.596 --> 00:00:13.160
as a triumph of classic Italian cinema.

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:17.160
Ladies and gentlemen,
here is the movie trailer.

00:01:50.284 --> 00:01:52.886
(laughing)
(applauding)

00:01:52.886 --> 00:01:53.754
Hello.

00:01:53.754 --> 00:01:54.921
Alright, Ciao.

00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:57.581
Where is everyone from in the class?

00:01:57.581 --> 00:02:01.664
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.071
She's asking if I'm your assistant?

00:02:06.071 --> 00:02:07.822
No, he does nothing.

00:02:14.505 --> 00:02:15.338
What are you saying?

00:02:15.338 --> 00:02:16.171
I have various tasks.

00:02:16.171 --> 00:02:17.004
No, he doesn't have various tasks.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.830
He does not have the vocabulary of the

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.840
Italian language, but
he has the drama of the

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:22.900
Italian language.
I have the drama,

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.460
I use my hands.

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.210
How do you say hands?

00:02:29.707 --> 00:02:34.707
(grumbling)

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:37.560
She has the authority in this room.

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.715
She is the teacher.

00:02:38.715 --> 00:02:40.313
She is in control.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.090
They are well behaved, they listen.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:43.923
And look at you.

00:02:43.923 --> 00:02:45.710
You're an animal.

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:46.920
You eat a brochure.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.400
She said I'm an animal?

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.350
Did she say I'm an animal?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.580
I am paraphrasing.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.503
Okay, I should probably explain.

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:59.490
Two students left, they
couldn't take it anymore.

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.323
Ray, can you say why you
think those two left?

00:03:09.775 --> 00:03:12.244
(laughing)

00:03:12.244 --> 00:03:14.577
(spy music)

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:28.238
(motorbike puttering)

